UID:P6cd1d1h5Q
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 84 mins (1h24m)\n\nSeattle Film Critics Society Paci
 fic Northwest Awards In the remote expanses of Eastern Oregon\, a rash of 
 unexplained cattle mutilations reignites a decades-old mystery of the Amer
 ican West. Film team scheduled to attend for introduction and Q&A.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/seattle-film-critics-society-pnw-awar
 ds-2025/not-one-drop-of-blood\n\nEstimated start: 18:00
